From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Tue, 30 Jun 2026 05:12:05 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 05001/11362] [conductor] In-process docs for PHASE D4
 (VERIFIER MOAT; CROSS-CORPUS GENERALIZATION) -- evaluate the BEST D1/D2/D3
 oracle-distinct verifier on a SECOND headroom-present oracle-distinct corpus
 (GPQA / MMLU-Pro-hard / MATH-500-hard, whichever is cached + headroom_present
 vs the GENUINE tuned-SC). The gate requires MuSR + >=1 second corpus: a
 single-corpus win could be corpus-specific. Honest MuSR-scoped record if no
 2nd corpus is headroom-present.

Co-Authored-By: Codex CLI <noreply@openai.com>
